having the right to exchange their shares for cash, securities or other property, the founder shares will be released from the Lock-up.</span></p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.25in">&#160;</p><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-weight: bold;">Private
